# Build context for offline-processing images is the repo root. Keep it lean and
# never ship host-built (macOS) node_modules or secrets into the Linux image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Workspaces / dirs the offline-processing images don't need. frontend is a root
# npm workspace, so its manifest must stay for `npm install` to resolve — but we
# don't need its source or deps in the image.
frontend
!frontend/package.json
claude-brain
designs
readme
db_backups
lightroom-export-presets
**/*.db
**/public/images
**/public/thumbnails
